rnment, to believe with insight and commitment, and to act with confidence, compassion and competence. If you would like to be a part of our team, browse our current job opportunities. What Makes Burman Attractive: A beautiful community in the bustling Calgary-Edmonton corridor A collegial, supportive, university community Flexibility and opportunities for growth and responsibility Smaller average class sizes of less than 20 students Nearby shopping in Red Deer and Edmonton Nearby churches with opportunities for meaningful involvement Position Department Salary Date Maintenance Assistant Facility Maintenance See advert Until filled Administrative Assistant President's Office See advert Until filled Email cover letters, resumes and three references (combination of employment and character) to hroffice@burmanu.ca . When applying for staff positions (not faculty), please merge cover letter and resume into one file when emailing documents. Applications without references will be considered incomplete. Reference details: Name, Title, Position, Email Address and Phone #. Visit Apply Give About Contact Campus Calendar Library Campus Directory Programs & Degrees Vision & Mission Job Opportunities Burman University 6730 University Drive Lacombe, AB Canada T4L 2E5 403.786.2551 800.661.8129 Toll-free Top"
